---
/** Automated Inquiry — a message becomes a brief; the gap is asked about;
    nothing moves until the traveller confirms. */
---
<div class="mk-panel wide">
  <div class="mk-head"><b>New inquiry</b><small>via email · 09:14</small></div>
  <div class="mk-msg sys"><p>"Two of us, Kenya in early March, about 9 nights, Mara for sure. Budget-wise, mid-range."</p></div>
  <div class="mk-row2">
    <div class="mk-field"><label>Where</label><div>Kenya · Mara</div></div>
    <div class="mk-field"><label>When</label><div>3 – 12 March</div></div>
    <div class="mk-field"><label>Who</label><div>2 adults</div></div>
    <div class="mk-field"><label>Budget</label><div class="ph focus">Asked · awaiting reply</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="mk-row plain" style="border-bottom:0"><div><b>Confirm the brief with the traveller</b><small>Sent to Lena · moves to Planning on "yes"</small></div><span class="mk-chk wait"></span></div>
</div>
